silm:instances_papers_19_mereology_as_colimit_chapters_12_cross_paper_bridges_b_sections_01_cross_paper_bridge_disintegration_yoneda_hom_leg silm:hasExample "In 'CrossPaperBridgeDisintegrationYonedaHomLeg', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, In 'Cross-Paper Bridge: Disintegration (Paper 30)', the cocone_factorisation arrow witnesses a typed leg between Mittens and VetCarePlan_77 under the mereology-as-colimit law of the Mittens cocone with cocone-compatibility triangle closure.; also, In 'Cross-Paper Bridge: Disintegration (Paper 30)', the evidence_witness arrow witnesses a typed leg between VetRecord and Mittens under the mereology-as-colimit law of the Mittens cocone with cocone-compatibility triangle closure." .
